  "independence": "Low-pass and high-pass expected EQ impulses are algebraic at omega=pi/2,Q=1/2: the unnormalized denominator is [2,0,0]. Peak zero gain cancels numerator/denominator. The boosted peak uses A=2, normalized b=[2,0,-2/3], a=[1,0,1/3], h[0]=2 and h[2]=-4/3; subsequent even impulse samples multiply the preceding even sample by -1/3, and odd samples are zero. Compressor constants use analytic piecewise and e-fold solutions. First reverb wet=1/2*1/2*1/sqrt(8)*1/sqrt(8)=1/32. Frame counts use exact rational duration. Dither digest vectors independently obtained with OpenSSL SHA256, not the checker implementation.",
